# The documentary. Neither of these is a secret — they are public YouTube links,
# and they live here so a fresh clone has a working gate without a trip to the
# Netlify dashboard.
#
# On Netlify these are set as build-time environment variables, scoped to all
# scopes and all deploy contexts, NOT marked secret. Netlify reads them at build
# time, so adding or changing one needs a fresh deploy before it takes effect.
#
# If either is missing or malformed, the gate does not render at all. It never
# shows a dead link.
#
# The ?si= parameter is deliberately absent. That is YouTube's share-tracking
# tag, tied to the session that generated the link, and it does nothing on a
# public site link. Do not add it back.
DOC_URL_EN=https://youtu.be/6ZI0kq5tlZ8
DOC_URL_JA=https://youtu.be/511YVD2iPmE
